@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8DC
skinparam noteBorderColor #C9A227
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F0FA
  BorderColor #2F6FB5
}
[*] --> OFFLINE
OFFLINE --> BACKOFF : network back, or\nsocket dropped
BACKOFF --> CONNECTING : random delay\n(jitter, up to 60 s)
CONNECTING --> REGISTERED : TLS resumed, auth ok;\nsession written first
CONNECTING --> BACKOFF : failed: longer delay
REGISTERED --> SYNCING : SYNC {cursors}
SYNCING --> SYNCING : pages of missed messages;\nlive pushes held by seq
SYNCING --> BACKOFF_SYNC : RETRY_LATER\n(admission control)
BACKOFF_SYNC --> SYNCING : after the delay;\nthe socket stays open
SYNCING --> LIVE : LIVE frame
LIVE --> REPAIR : seq jumps past cursor + 1,\nor the periodic head check differs
REPAIR --> LIVE : gap filled by SYNC
LIVE --> OFFLINE : socket lost or app killed
@enduml
